Hoisted `profile`/`profileIndex` into locals and combined the invalid-profile and out-of-range cases into one guarded lookup, reducing repeated member loads. The behavior is unchanged.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    if (type != FIT_UINT8_INVALID)
        return type;

    const auto* p = profile;
    const auto idx = profileIndex;
    if (p != nullptr && idx < p->numFields)
        return p->fields[idx].type;

    return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;
}
```